Sval: Remove Gecko's references to removed components

Gecko's native code named documents, scripts and prefs of front-end
components Sval removed: the content security allowlists for Smart
Window, the AI chatbot, about:welcome, Spotlight, about:logins, the
synced tabs sidebar, about:inference and the selectable profile pages;
the HTML fragment allowlist entries for the New Tab add-on's bundle,
Reader View's voice picker and Smart Window's chat messages; Smart
Window in the frame loader's remote-frame exceptions; the New Tab
remote renderer's scheme in the script security manager; the reveal
event about:logins listened for on password fields; LaterRun's profile
creation time among the prefs kept from web content processes; and IP
Protection's ipp-vpn permission among those stripped of origin
attributes.

